\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces One index payload supports reconstruction and identification. The upper path shows the fixed $L=3$ codec interface. All reconstruction comparisons use the NAS-selected encoder. The lower path uses received indices and their matching reconstruction from frozen SCIT-LCA; classifier training does not update the speech codec or the ECAPA backbone. The token encoder, audio projection and fusion classifier are trained at the receiver. No separate identity embedding is transmitted. This diagram specifies the evaluated deep-learning components, not a completed multi-user transport experiment.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
